    "name": "Mole In The Hole",
    "steam_appid": 1621870,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621870/extras/2e8622ecde9374d429021e892882c0ec.webp?t=1745919585\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our mole on a journey underground, equipped with simple tools and\u00a0unyielding\u00a0 determination.\u00a0As the earth trembles and rocks cascade from above, your mission is to dig deeper, and achieve the highest score possible by choosing the best upgrade for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dual Terrain Challenge:</strong> Navigate through layers of stone and sand, each requiring a specific tool for efficient digging.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stone Blocks:</strong> Use the pickaxe to break through solid stone barriers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sand Blocks:</strong> Switch to the shovel to swiftly move through loose sand.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Treasure Troves:</strong> Keep an eye out for special blocks embedded with gold. Breaking these not only clears your path but also boosts your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy upgrades to increase the value of sand and stone tiles that will affect your final score.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621870/extras/c1e53facda92b495f97d021281ee99bf.poster.avif?t=1745919585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621870/extras/c1e53facda92b495f97d021281ee99bf.webm?t=1745919585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621870/extras/c1e53facda92b495f97d021281ee99bf.mp4?t=1745919585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from perks that affect gameplay and block value.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keyboard:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Movement:</strong>\u00a0Use the arrow keys (Left, Right, Down) or (W, A, S) to guide the mole's direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tool Switching:</strong>\u00a0Press the Spacebar or 'Q' to toggle between the pickaxe and shovel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enter Shop:</strong> Press 'E' or click on shop icon to choose from shop upgrades</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621870/extras/2e8622ecde9374d429021e892882c0ec.webp?t=1745919585\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our mole on a journey underground, equipped with simple tools and\u00a0unyielding\u00a0 determination.\u00a0As the earth trembles and rocks cascade from above, your mission is to dig deeper, and achieve the highest score possible by choosing the best upgrade for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dual Terrain Challenge:</strong> Navigate through layers of stone and sand, each requiring a specific tool for efficient digging.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stone Blocks:</strong> Use the pickaxe to break through solid stone barriers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sand Blocks:</strong> Switch to the shovel to swiftly move through loose sand.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Treasure Troves:</strong> Keep an eye out for special blocks embedded with gold. Breaking these not only clears your path but also boosts your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy upgrades to increase the value of sand and stone tiles that will affect your final score.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621870/extras/c1e53facda92b495f97d021281ee99bf.poster.avif?t=1745919585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621870/extras/c1e53facda92b495f97d021281ee99bf.webm?t=1745919585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\